  m_text: "\u0130yot Kristalleri: Koyu gri/siyah renkli kat\u0131 madde.\nBeher:
    Tepkimenin ger\xE7ekle\u015Fece\u011Fi kap.\n\u0130spirto Oca\u011F\u0131: Is\u0131
    kayna\u011F\u0131.\nSaat Cam\u0131 (Opsiyonel): Beherin \xFCzerine kapat\u0131lan
    kapak.\nSac Ayak ve Tel Kafes: Beheri ta\u015F\u0131mak i\xE7in."
