  m_text: "Deney Tan\u0131m\u0131: Kat\u0131 haldeki iyot kristallerinin, s\u0131v\u0131
    hale ge\xE7meden do\u011Frudan gaz (buhar) haline ge\xE7i\u015Fini ve ard\u0131ndan
    tekrar kat\u0131la\u015Fmas\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6zlemleme deneyidir."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
